WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:21.434
It was a bright morning in the park.

2
00:00:21.435 --> 00:00:27.704
Kip wanted to play with Bird.

3
00:00:27.705 --> 00:00:36.577
But she was away looking for worms.

4
00:00:36.578 --> 00:00:44.371
"I'm bored," said Kip.

5
00:00:44.372 --> 00:00:50.958
"I have nobody to play with.

6
00:00:50.959 --> 00:00:55.046
Maybe I'll collect acorns," said Kip.

7
00:00:55.047 --> 00:01:07.384
Kip did that for a little while.

8
00:01:07.385 --> 00:01:11.785
Soon he was bored again.

9
00:01:11.786 --> 00:01:26.168
"What else can I look for?" wondered Kip.

10
00:01:26.169 --> 00:01:38.851
Kip found a rusty can.

11
00:01:38.852 --> 00:01:54.949
He found an old shoe.

12
00:01:54.950 --> 00:01:58.196
And he found a slimy banana peel.

13
00:01:58.197 --> 00:02:06.435
"Yuck," said Kip.

14
00:02:06.436 --> 00:02:11.155
Then Kip found something very strange . . .

15
00:02:11.156 --> 00:02:17.173
Kip found a person!

16
00:02:17.174 --> 00:02:20.315
But this was not a big person.

17
00:02:20.316 --> 00:02:26.301
It was a small person.

18
00:02:26.302 --> 00:02:29.389
She was as small as Kip.

19
00:02:29.390 --> 00:02:35.281
"Hi," said Kip. "My name is Kip.

20
00:02:35.282 --> 00:02:37.480
What's your name?"

21
00:02:37.481 --> 00:02:40.038
The person didn't answer.

22
00:02:40.039 --> 00:02:47.735
She didn't say anything at all.

23
00:02:47.736 --> 00:02:56.759
"Hmm," said Kip. "Why don't you talk?"

